    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenBulb is a fun and colorful single-player jump-and-run game where you will be challenged in your skill and dexterity as you solve puzzles and tests of skill across 20 levels. GreenBulb has the ability to \u2018convert\u2019 a shape either by delivering a kick or by leaping onto it. Achieving multiple shape conversions without touching the ground will result in higher scores.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094610/extras/bdb16c8660374cab3c558780c7d860b5.avif?t=1729077949\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenBulb must battle the Shape Machine, a terrible duplication device that unleashes an unending stream of repetitive forms, devoid of meaning or essence. Only GreenBulb can save the world from this grim fate by transforming these lifeless shapes into objects full of color and joy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094610/extras/5121d2c0fca2c76a0722779432bae89f.avif?t=1729077949\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: Levels 1-8 are free to play, providing a fun and challenging experience at no cost. To access levels beyond Level 8, players can make a one-time purchase of the \u201cUnlock All Levels\u201d item for $2.99 USD, allowing seamless progression through the final Boss Level.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenBulb is a fun and colorful single-player jump-and-run game where you will be challenged in your skill and dexterity as you solve puzzles and tests of skill across 20 levels. GreenBulb has the ability to \u2018convert\u2019 a shape either by delivering a kick or by leaping onto it. Achieving multiple shape conversions without touching the ground will result in higher scores.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094610/extras/bdb16c8660374cab3c558780c7d860b5.avif?t=1729077949\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenBulb must battle the Shape Machine, a terrible duplication device that unleashes an unending stream of repetitive forms, devoid of meaning or essence. Only GreenBulb can save the world from this grim fate by transforming these lifeless shapes into objects full of color and joy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094610/extras/5121d2c0fca2c76a0722779432bae89f.avif?t=1729077949\" data-has-big width=800 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: Levels 1-8 are free to play, providing a fun and challenging experience at no cost. To access levels beyond Level 8, players can make a one-time purchase of the \u201cUnlock All Levels\u201d item for $2.99 USD, allowing seamless progression through the final Boss Level.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "GreenBulb is a vibrant, single-player jump-and-run game for all ages, where players use skill and dexterity to solve puzzles and tackle challenges across 20 exciting levels. GreenBulb offers a delightful and accessible experience for players of all skill levels.",
